{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">EXP function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":2879,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/309435","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/EXP-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/EXP-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"EXP-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">EXP function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Returns the result of raising a number to a\npower. The number is called the <var class=\"keyword varname\">base</var> and the\npower is called the <var class=\"keyword varname\">exponent</var>.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"EXP-function__syntax_GC17JK2691290\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d497931e102\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"EXP-function__idGDK2CA2669347\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>EXP ( <var class=\"keyword varname\">base</var> , <var class=\"keyword varname\">exponent</var> )</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">base</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A constant, field name, variable name, or expression that evaluates to\na numeric value.</dd>\n        \n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">exponent</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A numeric expression.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"EXP-function__example_GC17JL2691297\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d497931e161\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">This\nprocedure calculates how much a principal amount invested at a given compounded\nannual interest rate grows over a specified number of years:</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <strong class=\"ph b\">r-exp.p</strong>\n      </p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"EXP-function__idGDK2CB2669354\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>DEFINE VARIABLE principal AS DECIMAL NO-UNDO FORMAT &quot;-&gt;&gt;&gt;,&gt;&gt;9.99&quot;\n  LABEL &quot;Amt Invested&quot;.\nDEFINE VARIABLE rate      AS INTEGER NO-UNDO FORMAT &quot;-&gt;9&quot;\n  LABEL &quot;Interest %&quot;.\nDEFINE VARIABLE num-yrs   AS INTEGER NO-UNDO FORMAT &quot;&gt;&gt;9&quot;\n  LABEL &quot;Number of Years&quot;.\nDEFINE VARIABLE final-amt AS DECIMAL NO-UNDO FORMAT\n  &quot;-&gt;&gt;&gt;,&gt;&gt;&gt;,&gt;&gt;&gt;,&gt;&gt;&gt;,&gt;&gt;&gt;,&gt;&gt;9.99&quot; LABEL &quot;Final Amount&quot;.\n\nREPEAT:\n  UPDATE principal rate num-yrs.\n  final-amt = principal * <strong class=\"ph b\">EXP(1 + rate / 100,num-yrs).</strong>\n  DISPLAY final-amt.\nEND.</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"EXP-function__notes_GC17JM2691303\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d497931e199\">Notes</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n        <li class=\"li\">After\nconverting the base and exponent to the floating-point format, the\nEXP function uses standard system library routines. On some machines,\nthese routines do not handle large numbers well and might cause\nyour terminal to hang. Also, because the calculations are done in floating-point\narithmetic, full decimal precision is not possible beyond 1-12 significant\ndigits on most machines.</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">The EXP function is precise to approximately 10 decimal points.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"ETIME-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ETIME-function.html\">ETIME function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"EXPORT-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/EXPORT-statement.html\">EXPORT statement</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309435","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":2879,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"EXP function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/EXP-function.html","type":"Manual"}